Package: waybar
Version: @DEB_WAYBAR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libglib2.0-0, libgtkmm-3.0-1v5, libgtk-layer-shell0
Description: GTK Wayland status bar
 Waybar is a customizable GTK/gtkmm status bar for wlroots-style Wayland
 compositors. This rootless iOS build starts with a minimal module set for the
 iosc compositor: clock plus custom modules only. Linux daemon, audio, tray,
 input-device, and compositor-specific modules are disabled for first light.
